  "slug": "passion-fruit-fizz-martini-recipe-8786408",
  "name": "Passion Fruit Fizz Martini",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This passion fruit fizz martini is a vibrant, effervescent cocktail that brings a taste of the tropics to your glass. You can find passionfruit pulp, with or without seeds, in the frozen aisle of most international markets.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a cocktail shaker, combine vodka, passion fruit pulp, simple syrup, lime juice and ice. Shake well until the outside of the shaker is frosted, about 15 seconds."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Strain into a martini glass. Use a Hawthorne cocktail strainer to retain passion fruit seeds in the drink, or use a fine mesh strainer to strain out seeds. Top with chilled Champagne, and garnish with lime wheel."
    }
  ],
